(5923962, 863836, 112861, '<td valign="top">I like portal. It''s neutral and could mean enter or exit. (Which it looks like you have here.)</td>', 'I like portal. It''s neutral and could mean enter or exit. (Which it looks like you have here.)', '2010-03-31 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
