(5923969, 863414, 70181, '<td valign="top">Fabulous perspective.  Great detail, depth, and the black and white works perfectly.  Thank you for giving us something different from all the other shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Fabulous perspective.  Great detail, depth, and the black and white works perfectly.  Thank you for giving us something different from all the other shots in this challenge.', '2010-03-31 19:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
