(5923972, 864012, 112861, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. No fair - you pick one of the best all-time song titles and coerced me with it. (You may have sneakily used some type of "Golden Sections" in there somewhere.)</td>', 'I really like this one. No fair - you pick one of the best all-time song titles and coerced me with it. (You may have sneakily used some type of "Golden Sections" in there somewhere.)', '2010-03-31 19:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
