(5924129, 863412, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent! A very strong vertical construct, combining nice blends of light green to blue to sky blue to purple, with a horizontal underlayment of light green and light blue, and a background of tan to dark green to light green. <br/>This gives a very peaceful feeling, relaxing, like looking at trees or plants and a lake. <br/>Definite a gallery quality shot. Fine Art at its best!</td>', 'This is magnificent! A very strong vertical construct, combining nice blends of light green to blue to sky blue to purple, with a horizontal underlayment of light green and light blue, and a background of tan to dark green to light green. This gives a very peaceful feeling, relaxing, like looking at trees or plants and a lake. Definite a gallery quality shot. Fine Art at its best!', '2010-03-31 22:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924131, 863769, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy shot, with lots to look at. Nice focus. Nice added splotches of color (flag, Irish, cross). Lighting is difficult, but handled well.</td>', 'This is a very busy shot, with lots to look at. Nice focus. Nice added splotches of color (flag, Irish, cross). Lighting is difficult, but handled well.', '2010-03-31 22:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
