(5924378, 863428, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, that is so not good.  Hopefully he didn''t hit those rocks with his head and managed to escape serious injury.  Good choice for the challenge, though!</td>', 'Oh, that is so not good.  Hopefully he didn''t hit those rocks with his head and managed to escape serious injury.  Good choice for the challenge, though!', '2010-04-01 01:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
