(5926433, 863428, 37845, '<td valign="top">This looks like a still image from a video on failblog.com<br/> <br/>I feel really guilty about this, but I did chuckle when I saw this.... Hope this guy is alright though :)<br/> <br/>ETA: Hold on a second.... I just came back to this. It is quite fortuitous that you were ready with your camera at this exact moment... makes me think you sabotaged the route to ensure this ''accident''... I''m onto you!!!!</td>', 'This looks like a still image from a video on failblog.com I feel really guilty about this, but I did chuckle when I saw this.... Hope this guy is alright though :) ETA: Hold on a second.... I just came back to this. It is quite fortuitous that you were ready with your camera at this exact moment... makes me think you sabotaged the route to ensure this ''accident''... I''m onto you!!!!', '2010-04-01 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926438, 863412, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Monet. Love the soft pastel colours, and it has great lines. Definitely an abstract, and metaphorical interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a Monet. Love the soft pastel colours, and it has great lines. Definitely an abstract, and metaphorical interpretation of the challenge.', '2010-04-01 20:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926439, 863001, 37845, '<td valign="top">The addition of the clump of hair in the lower left is both gross and a perfect addition. This is the very definition of an "Ewwww... 10"</td>', 'The addition of the clump of hair in the lower left is both gross and a perfect addition. This is the very definition of an "Ewwww... 10"', '2010-04-01 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926442, 863854, 37845, '<td valign="top">Outtake from ''Orange''?  Whether it is, or not, I love the lines and shadows in this shot. Well seen.</td>', 'Outtake from ''Orange''?  Whether it is, or not, I love the lines and shadows in this shot. Well seen.', '2010-04-01 20:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926445, 864052, 37845, '<td valign="top">Because I have seen this composition many times before, the silhoette in the tunnel comes across as cliche... yet, this is still a powerful shot. Perhaps that is why this ''cliche'' works so well. Great shot.</td>', 'Because I have seen this composition many times before, the silhoette in the tunnel comes across as cliche... yet, this is still a powerful shot. Perhaps that is why this ''cliche'' works so well. Great shot.', '2010-04-01 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926447, 863414, 37845, '<td valign="top">Incredible perspective... the tilt, the DOF, the black and white processing to make the shot look bleak and desperate. Amongst the top photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Incredible perspective... the tilt, the DOF, the black and white processing to make the shot look bleak and desperate. Amongst the top photos in this challenge.', '2010-04-01 20:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926452, 863861, 111808, '<td valign="top">This has a very odd perspective in it, and it takes time &amp; study to realise what &amp; how it is. Intriguing capture.</td>', 'This has a very odd perspective in it, and it takes time & study to realise what & how it is. Intriguing capture.', '2010-04-01 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926459, 863980, 111808, '<td valign="top">Pleasing juxtaposition of the lighter colours &amp; the outside brilliant blue sky. The reflections &amp; repeating lines are also a plus to your composition.</td>', 'Pleasing juxtaposition of the lighter colours & the outside brilliant blue sky. The reflections & repeating lines are also a plus to your composition.', '2010-04-01 21:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926464, 864024, 111808, '<td valign="top">An outside the box take on the challenge - T I X E - the reds are very eyecatching. The layering almost makes this look tri-dimensional.</td>', 'An outside the box take on the challenge - T I X E - the reds are very eyecatching. The layering almost makes this look tri-dimensional.', '2010-04-01 21:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926470, 863985, 111808, '<td valign="top">Very creative theme flow &amp; colourwise this is a treat - LOVE the title reference. It does look abstractedly haunted.</td>', 'Very creative theme flow & colourwise this is a treat - LOVE the title reference. It does look abstractedly haunted.', '2010-04-01 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926487, 863414, 111808, '<td valign="top">This point of view is an interesting one but also very disturbing as well. How many of us could look down at this from the point of the prospective jumper &amp; not notice all the rest? The hand has a very tight grip on the railing - that is good.</td>', 'This point of view is an interesting one but also very disturbing as well. How many of us could look down at this from the point of the prospective jumper & not notice all the rest? The hand has a very tight grip on the railing - that is good.', '2010-04-01 21:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926491, 863857, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like this although the ornate spirals &amp; curves of the door remind me of a Faery Portal.</td>', 'I like this although the ornate spirals & curves of the door remind me of a Faery Portal.', '2010-04-01 21:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926501, 863967, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the reds, pinks &amp; yellows of the lava eruption contrasting with the cool blues and whites of the snowy background are superb.</td>', 'Beautiful - the reds, pinks & yellows of the lava eruption contrasting with the cool blues and whites of the snowy background are superb.', '2010-04-01 21:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
