(5936297, 863412, 51747, '<td valign="top">quote from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a> in comments about this image "Thanks for the comments, surprised so many people didn''t get the connection."<br/> <br/> Can you clue us in as to what the connection is? Please :)</td>', 'quote from  bspurgeon in comments about this image "Thanks for the comments, surprised so many people didn''t get the connection."  Can you clue us in as to what the connection is? Please :)', '2010-04-07 21:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
