(5995158, 863412, 30982, '<td valign="top">I disagree with removing the two foreground trees - I very much like them there.  In the context of this challenge and therefore the impetus behind this shot, those two form the gateway, don''t you think?  I love the almost embossed/metallic/silk feel of this.  Don''t know if that can be replicated.</td>', 'I disagree with removing the two foreground trees - I very much like them there.  In the context of this challenge and therefore the impetus behind this shot, those two form the gateway, don''t you think?  I love the almost embossed/metallic/silk feel of this.  Don''t know if that can be replicated.', '2010-05-07 01:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
